{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262vEKoNYl7P1795356035.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港公開羽毛球錦標賽，國家隊的王祉怡女單成功衛冕。</p><p></p><p>紅衫的王祉怡，晉級過程一局不失，決賽面對泰國的李美妙，打出5-2開局，這位世界第三的26歲球手，首局全程領先下，先贏21-16。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.BADMINTON.WRAP-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zxeVK8h2Lx1795356043.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>上一次奪冠，是三月的全英賽，今次王祉怡成功衛冕，亦打破過去八個月的「冠軍荒」，雖然第二局，開局連失2分，但她很快反超並帶到尾，大勝21-11，王祉怡直落兩局稱后，賽後將頭巾送給去到啟德現場的球迷。</p><p></p><p>球迷就以掌聲回報。王祉怡成為第五位成功在香港站衛冕的球手。</p><p></p><p>男單的昆拉武特退賽，安東臣自動成為冠軍。混雙決賽就上演國家隊「內訌」，紅衫紅褲的馮彥哲和黃東萍，落後一局下，先以21-9追平。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.BADMINTON.WRAP-2000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267qOVYcsYay1795356183.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>蔣振邦及魏雅欣決勝局領先過4-1，中段被反先，馮彥哲飛身救球，黃東萍頂著，對方扣殺出界後，再贏21-15，反勝局數2-1奪冠。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T15:03:50.664135+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":347,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T13:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:57:10.448330+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:57:17.472120+00:00","content_hash":"b9a43e4dbb4f0680ff6a57d4f49bfee6aad7ccbb59f5fcea07afaeb1fb548f25","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T15:03:50.664135+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}